result={'kind':'Compact canonical boundary remapping: paired CPU/allocation and fallback controls','baseline_commit':'a667a95a','started_utc':start,'finished_utc':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'host':platform.platform(),'methodology':'Identical offline release probe source/lock, isolated targets; prior measured binaries untouched. Allocator-disabled ABBA twice per phase/case, four fresh processes/version, one warmup plus five samples. Separate allocation processes.136 matched cases:104 existing raw/encoded scene preparation/cold-cache/software/upload/submission/range controls plus32 focused mesh collect/owner-visitor cases. Scene inputs point/cell/gradient/general16/48, lines/points256/65536. Mesh inputs canonical16/48 at tiny and one-chunk cutoff-1/exact/+1/default caps, canonical96 small/default, general48 small/default, thin2x48x48 default. Focused source creation/full validation outside clock; complete canonical proof inside extraction. Mesh collect wraps chunks with empty owner Vecs for shared checking; owner visitor retains owner copies in its callback, all within clock. Scene standalone preparation includes validation; cold Scene.prepare includes validation/bounds/cache bookkeeping, clear/drop and subsequent image checks excluded. Warm software uses retained geometry; upload borrows surface arrays and packs primitives; CPU submission excludes completion/readback. Range changes retain compatible geometry in both variants. Process and main-thread CPU clocks captured; wall usesInstant. Extra thread-clock calls change timing overhead relative to prior checkpoint, so only current paired comparisons support code costs. All136 cross-version output hashes/payload lengths exact; all104 prior scene controls match retained checkpoint. Checks/hash/drop outside clock; no task-owned builds/checks/sampling during measurement; thermal/affinity uncontrolled. Focused RSS ABBA twice via time-l performs one mesh collection and exits before GPU init, including linked binaries/source creation/hash; not mobile/GPU residency or whole-app/energy qualification. Existing overdraw/short-sample timing variation remains relevant. Allocation counts measure Rust calls/positive realloc growth, not live/native/GPU storage. Source/output/cache/global budgets remain open.','source_sha256':sources,'production_source':{f:(ROOT/f).read_text() for f in files if f.startswith('crates/gpui-mesh/src/') or f.startswith('crates/gpui-scene3d/src/')},'probe_source':probe,'probe_manifests':{v:(p/'Cargo.toml').read_text() for v,p in packages.items()},'probe_lock':locks['baseline'],'probe_lock_sha256':sha(locks['baseline'].encode()),'binary_sha256':binaries,'orchestration_source':Path(__file__).read_text(),'orchestration_sha256':sha(Path(__file__).read_bytes()),'verification':qa,'build_checks':build_records,'check_runner_source':(TMP/'gpui-boundary-remap-checks.py').read_text(),'build_runner_source':(TMP/'gpui-boundary-remap-builds.py').read_text(),'previous_reference':{'path':str(reference.relative_to(ROOT)),'sha256':sha(reference.read_bytes()),'reason':'All104 shared scene output hashes/payloads remain exact for both versions;32 focused mesh cases extend cutoff/fallback coverage.'},'summary':summary,'runs':runs,'rss':rss,'rss_summary':[{'kind':kind,'n':n,'cap':cap,'bytes':{v:statistics.median(x['max_rss_bytes'] for x in rss if (x['kind'],x['n'],x['cap'],x['version'])==(kind,n,cap,v)) for v in roots}} for kind,n,cap in [('canonical',48,1_000_000),('canonical',96,1_000_000),('canonical',48,256),('general',48,1_000_000)]]}
